Package: pull-vids
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ffmpeg
Suggests: python3-pip
Maintainer: pull-vids contributors <https://github.com/vib795/pull-vids>
Homepage: https://github.com/vib795/pull-vids
Description: Free CLI tool for downloading YouTube videos and audio
 A free, open-source CLI tool for downloading YouTube videos and audio.
 Inspired by tools like Downie and PullTube, but completely free!
 .
 Features:
  - Download YouTube videos in various qualities (360p to 4K)
  - Download audio-only (MP3, M4A, etc.)
  - Support for playlists
  - Beautiful real-time progress bars
  - Fast startup (< 1ms)
 .
 Note: Requires yt-dlp to be installed (pip install yt-dlp)
